Creating a slave (node):
------------------------
    Steps:
        - create new linux server
        - install java
        - Got to Jenkins:
            Manage Jenkins --> Manage Nodes --> New Node
        Select: Permanent Agent
        Provide:
            Name
            Remote directory
            IP Address
            Credentials (PEM key)

    Connection Type:
        SSH

    Verify:
        Status --> Online
        Logs show:
            Agent successfully connected

    Executors:
    ----------
        Number of jobs that can run parllely
        Example: 5 --> 5 jobs can run at same time

    !! Depends on: Server CPU, RAM
